# Secrets arrive as files and are read before anything else resolves a property.
# `spring.datasource.password` is resolved while the data source is built, long
# before any bean of ours exists, so this has to be a post-processor.
#
# Tracing is here for the same reason a step earlier: whether a tracer exists at
# all is decided by auto-configuration conditions, which read properties before
# any bean of ours could correct one (REQ-NFR-044).
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
  de.greluc.homeinv.platform.SecretFiles,\
  de.greluc.homeinv.platform.TracingEnvironment
